    markdown:
      "## retrieve_capabilities\n\n`client.cardTokens.retrieveCapabilities(card_token_id: string): { routes: object[]; type: 'card_token_capabilities'; }`\n\n**get** `/card_tokens/{card_token_id}/capabilities`\n\nThe capabilities of a Card Token describe whether the card can be used for specific operations, such as Card Push Transfers. The capabilities can change over time based on the issuing bank's configuration of the card range.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `card_token_id: string`\n  The identifier of the Card Token.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ routes: { cross_border_push_transfers: 'supported' | 'not_supported'; domestic_push_transfers: 'supported' | 'not_supported'; issuer_country: string; route: 'visa' | 'mastercard'; }[]; type: 'card_token_capabilities'; }`\n  The capabilities of a Card Token describe whether the card can be used for specific operations, such as Card Push Transfers. The capabilities can change over time based on the issuing bank's configuration of the card range.\n\n  - `routes: { cross_border_push_transfers: 'supported' | 'not_supported'; domestic_push_transfers: 'supported' | 'not_supported'; issuer_country: string; route: 'visa' | 'mastercard'; }[]`\n  - `type: 'card_token_capabilities'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst response = await client.cardTokens.retrieveCapabilities('outbound_card_token_zlt0ml6youq3q7vcdlg0');\n\nconsole.log(response);\n```",
