    markdown:
      "## create\n\n`client.externalAccounts.create(account_number: string, description: string, routing_number: string, account_holder?: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown', funding?: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger' | 'other'): { id: string; account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'; account_number: string; created_at: string; description: string; funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger' | 'other'; idempotency_key: string; routing_number: string; status: 'active' | 'archived'; type: 'external_account'; }`\n\n**post** `/external_accounts`\n\nCreate an External Account\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `account_number: string`\n  The account number for the destination account.\n\n- `description: string`\n  The name you choose for the Account.\n\n- `routing_number: string`\n  The American Bankers' Association (ABA) Routing Transit Number (RTN) for the destination account.\n\n- `account_holder?: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'`\n  The type of entity that owns the External Account.\n\n- `business` - The External Account is owned by a business.\n- `individual` - The External Account is owned by an individual.\n- `unknown` - It's unknown what kind of entity owns the External Account.\n\n- `funding?: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger' | 'other'`\n  The type of the destination account. Defaults to `checking`.\n\n- `checking` - A checking account.\n- `savings` - A savings account.\n- `general_ledger` - A general ledger account.\n- `other` - A different type of account.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'; account_number: string; created_at: string; description: string; funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger' | 'other'; idempotency_key: string; routing_number: string; status: 'active' | 'archived'; type: 'external_account'; }`\n  External Accounts represent accounts at financial institutions other than Increase. You can use this API to store their details for reuse.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'`\n  - `account_number: string`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `description: string`\n  - `funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger' | 'other'`\n  - `idempotency_key: string`\n  - `routing_number: string`\n  - `status: 'active' | 'archived'`\n  - `type: 'external_account'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst externalAccount = await client.externalAccounts.create({\n  account_number: '987654321',\n  description: 'Landlord',\n  routing_number: '101050001',\n});\n\nconsole.log(externalAccount);\n```",
