      "## create\n\n`client.intrafiAccountEnrollments.create(account_id: string, email_address: string): { id: string; account_id: string; created_at: string; email_address: string; idempotency_key: string; intrafi_id: string; status: 'pending_enrolling' | 'enrolled' | 'pending_unenrolling' | 'unenrolled' | 'requires_attention'; type: 'intrafi_account_enrollment'; }`\n\n**post** `/intrafi_account_enrollments`\n\nEnroll an account in the IntraFi deposit sweep network\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `account_id: string`\n  The identifier for the account to be added to IntraFi.\n\n- `email_address: string`\n  The contact email for the account owner, to be shared with IntraFi.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_id: string; created_at: string; email_address: string; idempotency_key: string; intrafi_id: string; status: 'pending_enrolling' | 'enrolled' | 'pending_unenrolling' | 'unenrolled' | 'requires_attention'; type: 'intrafi_account_enrollment'; }`\n  IntraFi is a [network of financial institutions](https://www.intrafi.com/network-banks) that allows Increase users to sweep funds to multiple banks. This enables accounts to become eligible for additional Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (FDIC) insurance. An IntraFi Account Enrollment object represents the status of an account in the network. Sweeping an account to IntraFi doesn't affect funds availability.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_id: string`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `email_address: string`\n  - `idempotency_key: string`\n  - `intrafi_id: string`\n  - `status: 'pending_enrolling' | 'enrolled' | 'pending_unenrolling' | 'unenrolled' | 'requires_attention'`\n  - `type: 'intrafi_account_enrollment'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst intrafiAccountEnrollment = await client.intrafiAccountEnrollments.create({ account_id: 'account_in71c4amph0vgo2qllky', email_address: 'user@example.com' });\n\nconsole.log(intrafiAccountEnrollment);\n```",
