    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.pendingTransactions.list(account_id?: string, category?: { in?: string[]; }, created_at?: { after?: string; before?: string; on_or_after?: string; on_or_before?: string; }, cursor?: string, limit?: number, route_id?: string, status?: { in?: 'pending' | 'complete'[]; }): { data: pending_transaction[]; next_cursor: string; }`\n\n**get** `/pending_transactions`\n\nList Pending Transactions\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `account_id?: string`\n  Filter pending transactions to those belonging to the specified Account.\n\n- `category?: { in?: string[]; }`\n  - `in?: string[]`\n    Return results whose value is in the provided list. For GET requests, this should be encoded as a comma-delimited string, such as `?in=one,two,three`.\n\n- `created_at?: { after?: string; before?: string; on_or_after?: string; on_or_before?: string; }`\n  - `after?: string`\n    Return results after this [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) timestamp.\n  - `before?: string`\n    Return results before this [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) timestamp.\n  - `on_or_after?: string`\n    Return results on or after this [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) timestamp.\n  - `on_or_before?: string`\n    Return results on or before this [ISO 8601](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) timestamp.\n\n- `cursor?: string`\n  Return the page of entries after this one.\n\n- `limit?: number`\n  Limit the size of the list that is returned. The default (and maximum) is 100 objects.\n\n- `route_id?: string`\n  Filter pending transactions to those belonging to the specified Route.\n\n- `status?: { in?: 'pending' | 'complete'[]; }`\n  - `in?: 'pending' | 'complete'[]`\n    Filter Pending Transactions for those with the specified status. By default only Pending Transactions in with status `pending` will be returned. For GET requests, this should be encoded as a comma-delimited string, such as `?in=one,two,three`.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ data: { id: string; account_id: string; amount: number; completed_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; description: string; held_amount: number; route_id: string; route_type: 'account_number' | 'card' | 'lockbox'; source: object; status: 'pending' | 'complete'; type: 'pending_transaction'; }[]; next_cursor: string; }`\n  A list of Pending Transaction objects.\n\n  - `data: { id: string; account_id: string; amount: number; completed_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; description: string; held_amount: number; route_id: string; route_type: 'account_number' | 'card' | 'lockbox'; source: { category: string; account_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; ach_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_offramp_transfer_instruction?: { source_blockchain_address_id: string; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_onramp_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; destination_blockchain_address: string; transfer_id: string; }; card_authorization?: object; card_push_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; check_deposit_instruction?: { amount: number; back_image_file_id: string; check_deposit_id: string; currency: 'USD'; front_image_file_id: string; }; check_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; fednow_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; inbound_funds_hold?: object; inbound_wire_transfer_reversal?: object; other?: object; real_time_payments_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; swift_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; user_initiated_hold?: object; wire_transfer_instruction?: { account_number: string; amount: number; message_to_recipient: string; routing_number: string; transfer_id: string; }; }; status: 'pending' | 'complete'; type: 'pending_transaction'; }[]`\n  - `next_cursor: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst pendingTransactions = await client.pendingTransactions.list();\n\nconsole.log(pendingTransactions);\n```",
