    markdown:
      "## list\n\n`client.physicalCardProfiles.list(cursor?: string, idempotency_key?: string, limit?: number, status?: { in?: 'pending_creating' | 'pending_reviewing' | 'rejected' | 'pending_submitting' | 'active' | 'archived'[]; }): { data: physical_card_profile[]; next_cursor: string; }`\n\n**get** `/physical_card_profiles`\n\nList Physical Card Profiles\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `cursor?: string`\n  Return the page of entries after this one.\n\n- `idempotency_key?: string`\n  Filter records to the one with the specified `idempotency_key` you chose for that object. This value is unique across Increase and is used to ensure that a request is only processed once. Learn more about [idempotency](https://increase.com/documentation/idempotency-keys).\n\n- `limit?: number`\n  Limit the size of the list that is returned. The default (and maximum) is 100 objects.\n\n- `status?: { in?: 'pending_creating' | 'pending_reviewing' | 'rejected' | 'pending_submitting' | 'active' | 'archived'[]; }`\n  - `in?: 'pending_creating' | 'pending_reviewing' | 'rejected' | 'pending_submitting' | 'active' | 'archived'[]`\n    Filter Physical Card Profiles for those with the specified statuses. For GET requests, this should be encoded as a comma-delimited string, such as `?in=one,two,three`.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ data: { id: string; back_image_file_id: string; carrier_image_file_id: string; contact_phone: string; created_at: string; creator: 'increase' | 'user'; description: string; front_image_file_id: string; idempotency_key: string; is_default: boolean; program_id: string; status: 'pending_creating' | 'pending_reviewing' | 'rejected' | 'pending_submitting' | 'active' | 'archived'; type: 'physical_card_profile'; }[]; next_cursor: string; }`\n  A list of Physical Card Profile objects.\n\n  - `data: { id: string; back_image_file_id: string; carrier_image_file_id: string; contact_phone: string; created_at: string; creator: 'increase' | 'user'; description: string; front_image_file_id: string; idempotency_key: string; is_default: boolean; program_id: string; status: 'pending_creating' | 'pending_reviewing' | 'rejected' | 'pending_submitting' | 'active' | 'archived'; type: 'physical_card_profile'; }[]`\n  - `next_cursor: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst physicalCardProfiles = await client.physicalCardProfiles.list();\n\nconsole.log(physicalCardProfiles);\n```",
