    markdown:
      "## create\n\n`client.realTimePaymentsTransfers.create(amount: number, creditor_name: string, source_account_number_id: string, unstructured_remittance_information: string, account_number?: string, debtor_name?: string, external_account_id?: string, require_approval?: boolean, routing_number?: string, ultimate_creditor_name?: string, ultimate_debtor_name?: string): { id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; acknowledgement: object; amount: number; approval: object; cancellation: object; created_at: string; created_by: object; creditor_name: string; currency: 'USD'; debtor_name: string; external_account_id: string; idempotency_key: string; pending_transaction_id: string; rejection: object; routing_number: string; source_account_number_id: string; status: string; submission: object; transaction_id: string; type: 'real_time_payments_transfer'; ultimate_creditor_name: string; ultimate_debtor_name: string; unstructured_remittance_information: string; }`\n\n**post** `/real_time_payments_transfers`\n\nCreate a Real-Time Payments Transfer\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `amount: number`\n  The transfer amount in USD cents. For Real-Time Payments transfers, must be positive.\n\n- `creditor_name: string`\n  The name of the transfer's recipient.\n\n- `source_account_number_id: string`\n  The identifier of the Account Number from which to send the transfer.\n\n- `unstructured_remittance_information: string`\n  Unstructured information that will show on the recipient's bank statement.\n\n- `account_number?: string`\n  The destination account number.\n\n- `debtor_name?: string`\n  The name of the transfer's sender. If not provided, defaults to the name of the account's entity.\n\n- `external_account_id?: string`\n  The ID of an External Account to initiate a transfer to. If this parameter is provided, `account_number` and `routing_number` must be absent.\n\n- `require_approval?: boolean`\n  Whether the transfer requires explicit approval via the dashboard or API.\n\n- `routing_number?: string`\n  The destination American Bankers' Association (ABA) Routing Transit Number (RTN).\n\n- `ultimate_creditor_name?: string`\n  The name of the ultimate recipient of the transfer. Set this if the creditor is an intermediary receiving the payment for someone else.\n\n- `ultimate_debtor_name?: string`\n  The name of the ultimate sender of the transfer. Set this if the funds are being sent on behalf of someone who is not the account holder at Increase.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; acknowledgement: { acknowledged_at: string; }; amount: number; approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }; cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }; created_at: string; created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }; creditor_name: string; currency: 'USD'; debtor_name: string; external_account_id: string; idempotency_key: string; pending_transaction_id: string; rejection: { reject_reason_additional_information: string; reject_reason_code: string; rejected_at: string; }; routing_number: string; source_account_number_id: string; status: string; submission: { submitted_at: string; transaction_identification: string; }; transaction_id: string; type: 'real_time_payments_transfer'; ultimate_creditor_name: string; ultimate_debtor_name: string; unstructured_remittance_information: string; }`\n  Real-Time Payments transfers move funds, within seconds, between your Increase account and any other account on the Real-Time Payments network.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_id: string`\n  - `account_number: string`\n  - `acknowledgement: { acknowledged_at: string; }`\n  - `amount: number`\n  - `approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }`\n  - `cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }`\n  - `creditor_name: string`\n  - `currency: 'USD'`\n  - `debtor_name: string`\n  - `external_account_id: string`\n  - `idempotency_key: string`\n  - `pending_transaction_id: string`\n  - `rejection: { reject_reason_additional_information: string; reject_reason_code: string; rejected_at: string; }`\n  - `routing_number: string`\n  - `source_account_number_id: string`\n  - `status: string`\n  - `submission: { submitted_at: string; transaction_identification: string; }`\n  - `transaction_id: string`\n  - `type: 'real_time_payments_transfer'`\n  - `ultimate_creditor_name: string`\n  - `ultimate_debtor_name: string`\n  - `unstructured_remittance_information: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst transfer = await client.realTimePaymentsTransfers.create({\n  amount: 100,\n  creditor_name: 'Ian Crease',\n  source_account_number_id: 'account_number_v18nkfqm6afpsrvy82b2',\n  unstructured_remittance_information: 'Invoice 29582',\n});\n\nconsole.log(transfer);\n```",
