      "{ id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; acknowledgement: object; addenda: object; amount: number; approval: object; cancellation: object; company_descriptive_date: string; company_discretionary_data: string; company_entry_description: string; company_id: string; company_name: string; created_at: string; created_by: object; currency: 'USD'; destination_account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'; external_account_id: string; funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger'; idempotency_key: string; inbound_funds_hold: inbound_funds_hold; individual_id: string; individual_name: string; network: 'ach'; notifications_of_change: object[]; pending_transaction_id: string; preferred_effective_date: object; return: object; routing_number: string; settlement: object; standard_entry_class_code: string; statement_descriptor: string; status: string; submission: object; transaction_id: string; type: 'ach_transfer'; }",
    markdown:
      "## submit\n\n`client.simulations.achTransfers.submit(ach_transfer_id: string): { id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; acknowledgement: object; addenda: object; amount: number; approval: object; cancellation: object; company_descriptive_date: string; company_discretionary_data: string; company_entry_description: string; company_id: string; company_name: string; created_at: string; created_by: object; currency: 'USD'; destination_account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'; external_account_id: string; funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger'; idempotency_key: string; inbound_funds_hold: inbound_funds_hold; individual_id: string; individual_name: string; network: 'ach'; notifications_of_change: object[]; pending_transaction_id: string; preferred_effective_date: object; return: object; routing_number: string; settlement: object; standard_entry_class_code: string; statement_descriptor: string; status: string; submission: object; transaction_id: string; type: 'ach_transfer'; }`\n\n**post** `/simulations/ach_transfers/{ach_transfer_id}/submit`\n\nSimulates the submission of an [ACH Transfer](#ach-transfers) to the Federal Reserve. This transfer must first have a `status` of `pending_approval` or `pending_submission`. In production, Increase submits ACH Transfers to the Federal Reserve three times per day on weekdays. Since sandbox ACH Transfers are not submitted to the Federal Reserve, this endpoint allows you to skip that delay and transition the ACH Transfer to a status of `submitted`.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `ach_transfer_id: string`\n  The identifier of the ACH Transfer you wish to submit.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; acknowledgement: { acknowledged_at: string; }; addenda: { category: 'freeform' | 'payment_order_remittance_advice' | 'other'; freeform?: { entries: object[]; }; payment_order_remittance_advice?: { invoices: object[]; }; }; amount: number; approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }; cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }; company_descriptive_date: string; company_discretionary_data: string; company_entry_description: string; company_id: string; company_name: string; created_at: string; created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }; currency: 'USD'; destination_account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'; external_account_id: string; funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger'; idempotency_key: string; inbound_funds_hold: { amount: number; automatically_releases_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; held_transaction_id: string; pending_transaction_id: string; released_at: string; status: 'held' | 'complete'; type: 'inbound_funds_hold'; }; individual_id: string; individual_name: string; network: 'ach'; notifications_of_change: { change_code: string; corrected_data: string; created_at: string; }[]; pending_transaction_id: string; preferred_effective_date: { date: string; settlement_schedule: 'same_day' | 'future_dated'; }; return: { created_at: string; raw_return_reason_code: string; return_reason_code: string; trace_number: string; transaction_id: string; transfer_id: string; }; routing_number: string; settlement: { settled_at: string; }; standard_entry_class_code: string; statement_descriptor: string; status: string; submission: { administrative_returns_expected_by: string; effective_date: string; expected_funds_settlement_at: string; expected_settlement_schedule: 'same_day' | 'future_dated'; submitted_at: string; trace_number: string; }; transaction_id: string; type: 'ach_transfer'; }`\n  ACH transfers move funds between your Increase account and any other account accessible by the Automated Clearing House (ACH).\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_id: string`\n  - `account_number: string`\n  - `acknowledgement: { acknowledged_at: string; }`\n  - `addenda: { category: 'freeform' | 'payment_order_remittance_advice' | 'other'; freeform?: { entries: { payment_related_information: string; }[]; }; payment_order_remittance_advice?: { invoices: { invoice_number: string; paid_amount: number; }[]; }; }`\n  - `amount: number`\n  - `approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }`\n  - `cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }`\n  - `company_descriptive_date: string`\n  - `company_discretionary_data: string`\n  - `company_entry_description: string`\n  - `company_id: string`\n  - `company_name: string`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }`\n  - `currency: 'USD'`\n  - `destination_account_holder: 'business' | 'individual' | 'unknown'`\n  - `external_account_id: string`\n  - `funding: 'checking' | 'savings' | 'general_ledger'`\n  - `idempotency_key: string`\n  - `inbound_funds_hold: { amount: number; automatically_releases_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; held_transaction_id: string; pending_transaction_id: string; released_at: string; status: 'held' | 'complete'; type: 'inbound_funds_hold'; }`\n  - `individual_id: string`\n  - `individual_name: string`\n  - `network: 'ach'`\n  - `notifications_of_change: { change_code: string; corrected_data: string; created_at: string; }[]`\n  - `pending_transaction_id: string`\n  - `preferred_effective_date: { date: string; settlement_schedule: 'same_day' | 'future_dated'; }`\n  - `return: { created_at: string; raw_return_reason_code: string; return_reason_code: string; trace_number: string; transaction_id: string; transfer_id: string; }`\n  - `routing_number: string`\n  - `settlement: { settled_at: string; }`\n  - `standard_entry_class_code: string`\n  - `statement_descriptor: string`\n  - `status: string`\n  - `submission: { administrative_returns_expected_by: string; effective_date: string; expected_funds_settlement_at: string; expected_settlement_schedule: 'same_day' | 'future_dated'; submitted_at: string; trace_number: string; }`\n  - `transaction_id: string`\n  - `type: 'ach_transfer'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst achTransfer = await client.simulations.achTransfers.submit('ach_transfer_uoxatyh3lt5evrsdvo7q');\n\nconsole.log(achTransfer);\n```",
    perLanguage: {
      http: {
        example:
          'curl https://api.increase.com/simulations/ach_transfers/$ACH_TRANSFER_ID/submit \\\n    -X POST \\\n    -H "Authorization: Bearer $YOLKEN_INCREASE_TEST_API_KEY"',
      },
      typescript: {
        method: 'client.simulations.achTransfers.submit',
        example:
          "import YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest({\n  apiKey: process.env['YOLKEN_INCREASE_TEST_API_KEY'], // This is the default and can be omitted\n});\n\nconst achTransfer = await client.simulations.achTransfers.submit(\n  'ach_transfer_uoxatyh3lt5evrsdvo7q',\n);\n\nconsole.log(achTransfer.id);",
      },
    },
