    markdown:
      "## release_inbound_funds_hold\n\n`client.simulations.pendingTransactions.releaseInboundFundsHold(pending_transaction_id: string): { id: string; account_id: string; amount: number; completed_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; description: string; held_amount: number; route_id: string; route_type: 'account_number' | 'card' | 'lockbox'; source: object; status: 'pending' | 'complete'; type: 'pending_transaction'; }`\n\n**post** `/simulations/pending_transactions/{pending_transaction_id}/release_inbound_funds_hold`\n\nThis endpoint simulates immediately releasing an Inbound Funds Hold, which might be created as a result of, for example, an ACH debit.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `pending_transaction_id: string`\n  The pending transaction to release. The pending transaction must have a `inbound_funds_hold` source.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_id: string; amount: number; completed_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; description: string; held_amount: number; route_id: string; route_type: 'account_number' | 'card' | 'lockbox'; source: { category: string; account_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; ach_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_offramp_transfer_instruction?: { source_blockchain_address_id: string; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_onramp_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; destination_blockchain_address: string; transfer_id: string; }; card_authorization?: object; card_push_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; check_deposit_instruction?: { amount: number; back_image_file_id: string; check_deposit_id: string; currency: 'USD'; front_image_file_id: string; }; check_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; fednow_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; inbound_funds_hold?: object; inbound_wire_transfer_reversal?: object; other?: object; real_time_payments_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; swift_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; user_initiated_hold?: object; wire_transfer_instruction?: { account_number: string; amount: number; message_to_recipient: string; routing_number: string; transfer_id: string; }; }; status: 'pending' | 'complete'; type: 'pending_transaction'; }`\n  Pending Transactions are potential future additions and removals of money from your bank account. They impact your available balance, but not your current balance. To learn more, see [Transactions and Transfers](/documentation/transactions-transfers).\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_id: string`\n  - `amount: number`\n  - `completed_at: string`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `currency: 'USD'`\n  - `description: string`\n  - `held_amount: number`\n  - `route_id: string`\n  - `route_type: 'account_number' | 'card' | 'lockbox'`\n  - `source: { category: string; account_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; ach_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_offramp_transfer_instruction?: { source_blockchain_address_id: string; transfer_id: string; }; blockchain_onramp_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; destination_blockchain_address: string; transfer_id: string; }; card_authorization?: { id: string; actioner: 'user' | 'increase' | 'network'; additional_amounts: { clinic: object; dental: object; original: object; prescription: object; surcharge: object; total_cumulative: object; total_healthcare: object; transit: object; unknown: object; vision: object; }; amount: number; card_payment_id: string; currency: 'USD'; digital_wallet_token_id: string; direction: 'settlement' | 'refund'; expires_at: string; merchant_acceptor_id: string; merchant_category_code: string; merchant_city: string; merchant_country: string; merchant_descriptor: string; merchant_postal_code: string; merchant_state: string; network_details: { category: 'visa' | 'pulse'; pulse: object; visa: object; }; network_identifiers: { authorization_identification_response: string; retrieval_reference_number: string; trace_number: string; transaction_id: string; }; network_risk_score: number; pending_transaction_id: string; physical_card_id: string; presentment_amount: number; presentment_currency: string; processing_category: string; real_time_decision_id: string; scheme_fees: { amount: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; fee_type: string; fixed_component: string; variable_rate: string; }[]; terminal_id: string; type: 'card_authorization'; verification: { card_verification_code: object; cardholder_address: object; cardholder_name: object; }; }; card_push_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; check_deposit_instruction?: { amount: number; back_image_file_id: string; check_deposit_id: string; currency: 'USD'; front_image_file_id: string; }; check_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; currency: 'USD'; transfer_id: string; }; fednow_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; inbound_funds_hold?: { amount: number; automatically_releases_at: string; created_at: string; currency: 'USD'; held_transaction_id: string; pending_transaction_id: string; released_at: string; status: 'held' | 'complete'; type: 'inbound_funds_hold'; }; inbound_wire_transfer_reversal?: { inbound_wire_transfer_id: string; }; other?: object; real_time_payments_transfer_instruction?: { amount: number; transfer_id: string; }; swift_transfer_instruction?: { transfer_id: string; }; user_initiated_hold?: object; wire_transfer_instruction?: { account_number: string; amount: number; message_to_recipient: string; routing_number: string; transfer_id: string; }; }`\n  - `status: 'pending' | 'complete'`\n  - `type: 'pending_transaction'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst pendingTransaction = await client.simulations.pendingTransactions.releaseInboundFundsHold('pending_transaction_k1sfetcau2qbvjbzgju4');\n\nconsole.log(pendingTransaction);\n```",
