    summary: 'Sandbox: Reverse a Wire Transfer',
    description:
      'Simulates the reversal of a [Wire Transfer](#wire-transfers) by the Federal Reserve due to error conditions. This will also create a [Transaction](#transaction) to account for the returned funds. This Wire Transfer must first have a `status` of `complete`.',
    stainlessPath: '(resource) simulations.wire_transfers > (method) reverse',
    qualified: 'client.simulations.wireTransfers.reverse',
    params: ['wire_transfer_id: string;'],
    response:
      "{ id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; amount: number; approval: object; cancellation: object; created_at: string; created_by: object; creditor: object; currency: 'USD'; debtor: object; external_account_id: string; idempotency_key: string; inbound_wire_drawdown_request_id: string; network: 'wire'; pending_transaction_id: string; remittance: object; reversal: object; routing_number: string; source_account_number_id: string; status: string; submission: object; transaction_id: string; type: 'wire_transfer'; }",
    markdown:
      "## reverse\n\n`client.simulations.wireTransfers.reverse(wire_transfer_id: string): { id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; amount: number; approval: object; cancellation: object; created_at: string; created_by: object; creditor: object; currency: 'USD'; debtor: object; external_account_id: string; idempotency_key: string; inbound_wire_drawdown_request_id: string; network: 'wire'; pending_transaction_id: string; remittance: object; reversal: object; routing_number: string; source_account_number_id: string; status: string; submission: object; transaction_id: string; type: 'wire_transfer'; }`\n\n**post** `/simulations/wire_transfers/{wire_transfer_id}/reverse`\n\nSimulates the reversal of a [Wire Transfer](#wire-transfers) by the Federal Reserve due to error conditions. This will also create a [Transaction](#transaction) to account for the returned funds. This Wire Transfer must first have a `status` of `complete`.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `wire_transfer_id: string`\n  The identifier of the Wire Transfer you wish to reverse.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; account_id: string; account_number: string; amount: number; approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }; cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }; created_at: string; created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }; creditor: { address: { unstructured: object; }; name: string; }; currency: 'USD'; debtor: { address: { unstructured: object; }; name: string; }; external_account_id: string; idempotency_key: string; inbound_wire_drawdown_request_id: string; network: 'wire'; pending_transaction_id: string; remittance: { category: 'unstructured' | 'tax'; tax?: { date: string; identification_number: string; type_code: string; }; unstructured?: { message: string; }; }; reversal: { amount: number; created_at: string; debtor_routing_number: string; description: string; input_cycle_date: string; input_message_accountability_data: string; input_sequence_number: string; input_source: string; instruction_identification: string; return_reason_additional_information: string; return_reason_code: string; return_reason_code_description: string; transaction_id: string; wire_transfer_id: string; }; routing_number: string; source_account_number_id: string; status: string; submission: { input_message_accountability_data: string; submitted_at: string; }; transaction_id: string; type: 'wire_transfer'; }`\n  Wire transfers move funds between your Increase account and any other account accessible by Fedwire.\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `account_id: string`\n  - `account_number: string`\n  - `amount: number`\n  - `approval: { approved_at: string; approved_by: string; }`\n  - `cancellation: { canceled_at: string; canceled_by: string; }`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `created_by: { category: 'api_key' | 'oauth_application' | 'user'; api_key?: { description: string; }; oauth_application?: { name: string; }; user?: { email: string; }; }`\n  - `creditor: { address: { unstructured: { line1: string; line2: string; line3: string; }; }; name: string; }`\n  - `currency: 'USD'`\n  - `debtor: { address: { unstructured: { line1: string; line2: string; line3: string; }; }; name: string; }`\n  - `external_account_id: string`\n  - `idempotency_key: string`\n  - `inbound_wire_drawdown_request_id: string`\n  - `network: 'wire'`\n  - `pending_transaction_id: string`\n  - `remittance: { category: 'unstructured' | 'tax'; tax?: { date: string; identification_number: string; type_code: string; }; unstructured?: { message: string; }; }`\n  - `reversal: { amount: number; created_at: string; debtor_routing_number: string; description: string; input_cycle_date: string; input_message_accountability_data: string; input_sequence_number: string; input_source: string; instruction_identification: string; return_reason_additional_information: string; return_reason_code: string; return_reason_code_description: string; transaction_id: string; wire_transfer_id: string; }`\n  - `routing_number: string`\n  - `source_account_number_id: string`\n  - `status: string`\n  - `submission: { input_message_accountability_data: string; submitted_at: string; }`\n  - `transaction_id: string`\n  - `type: 'wire_transfer'`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport YolkenIncreaseTest from 'yolken-increase-test';\n\nconst client = new YolkenIncreaseTest();\n\nconst wireTransfer = await client.simulations.wireTransfers.reverse('wire_transfer_5akynk7dqsq25qwk9q2u');\n\nconsole.log(wireTransfer);\n```",
